# Real tenant output - NEVER publish. Add this before your first commit.
#
# output/ covers everything, including the dated run and cycle directories added 25 Oct 2026:
#   output/runs/<timestamp>/      one scan
#   output/attestation/<quarter>/ one attestation cycle
#   output/latest-run.txt         pointer to the current run
#
# The filename patterns below are belt-and-braces. They catch a file that escaped output/ -
# which happens when someone runs a script with an explicit -OutputPath to "just look at
# something quickly" and forgets where it landed.
output/
*_inventory.json
*_ownership.csv
*_findings.json
attestation_records.json
attestation_results.json
attestation_report.md
control_report.md
cycle.json
latest-run.txt
agent_surface_notes.md

# Sanitised fixtures are the EXCEPTION and are meant to be published. Fabricated names and
# GUIDs only - this is what lets someone run the tool without a tenant.
!samples/**

# Local
.secrets/
*.local.ps1
